<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Oct 24 -ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Oct 24 -ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $997.1 billion in the week to October 24 from $1.0671 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     54.13		58.66</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     26.56		27.28</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  942.97	    1008.45</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    177.22	     179.44</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	715.17	     755.03</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    281.93	     312.08</p>
</text>
